  - name: APIM API
    url: http://apim-api.gravitee.gck.local
  - name: Edge Gateway
    url: http://edge.gravitee.gck.local
  # Gamma routes AM through hostnames rather than the host ports declared
  # by am/base.
  - name: AM Console
    url: http://am-console.gravitee.gck.local
  - name: AM Gateway
    url: http://am-gateway.gravitee.gck.local
  - name: AM API
    url: http://am-api.gravitee.gck.local
---
If you haven't already, run the one-time DNS setup so *.gck.local hostnames
resolve on your machine (may require sudo):

  gck setup dns

To configure the AM connection from Gamma:

  - Create a service account token in AM Console
  - Head to the platform module of Gamma: http://gamma-console.gravitee.gck.local
  - Use `http://am-api.gravitee.gck.local` as your AM URL
